s=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve baths for your guests by making sure tubs are filled and warmed by your fire-breathing dragons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play each level strategically to complete each animal's story and  objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about your animal guests coming from all walks of life, such as Ruck the mischievous Duck, Hana the elderly Capybara, or Hugo from the notorious Hippopota-mafia!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your rooms with bathhouse items such as rubber ducks, cherry blossom plants, hot springs banners, and even a katana display...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy upgrades for your tubs such as dragon training or magical filtration systems!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Sleepy Rocket"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209920/header.jpg?t=1746254185","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257060389,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060389/movie480.mp4?t=1746024867","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060389/movie_max.mp4?t=1746024867"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257060389/879c032f5c6022739321f69cde86927abcd93abb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746024867","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060389/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746024867","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060389/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746024867"}}],"name":"Bathhouse Creatures","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><st